<SPT><TTL>MAINTENANCE MATERIAL SUBMITTALS</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>Extra Materials</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Submit <SUB>spare parts</SUB> data for all materials and for each different item of equipment specified, after approval 
